    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/14ca783af7da1f5eee80645ea4a82766.poster.avif?t=1696403600\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/14ca783af7da1f5eee80645ea4a82766.webm?t=1696403600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/14ca783af7da1f5eee80645ea4a82766.mp4?t=1696403600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>This is a third-person adventure thriller with an interactive environment and intriguing quests in an open world. Solve puzzles, uncover the secrets of the suspicious Dr. Wood and his assistant Gloria, who reside in Strange Hill City.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/1d197d32a4d45f31eba5fbca97ea6b3d.poster.avif?t=1696403600\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/1d197d32a4d45f31eba5fbca97ea6b3d.webm?t=1696403600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/1d197d32a4d45f31eba5fbca97ea6b3d.mp4?t=1696403600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your adventure begins in the unique town of Strange Hill, where you'll encounter distinctive creatures and the denizens of this enigmatic locale. Here, you'll discover numerous valuable and unique items to interact with. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/7b6a6fed7efe2c331af163fa65a5ecbd.poster.avif?t=1696403600\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/7b6a6fed7efe2c331af163fa65a5ecbd.webm?t=1696403600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/7b6a6fed7efe2c331af163fa65a5ecbd.mp4?t=1696403600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>By undertaking tasks for the townspeople, you can delve deeper into their histories and destinies. You'll befriend a robot named Ben, and a hopper named Howard will become your companion. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/49268148fe9551771fb34cc0c740bb3b.poster.avif?t=1696403600\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/49268148fe9551771fb34cc0c740bb3b.webm?t=1696403600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/49268148fe9551771fb34cc0c740bb3b.mp4?t=1696403600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The game is filled with myriad puzzles and easter eggs \u2014 finding them all won't be easy, but their discovery will bring you immense pleasure and rewarding surprises.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/a1d5401f4dce2de6e93f03b1ec032c78.poster.avif?t=1696403600\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/a1d5401f4dce2de6e93f03b1ec032c78.webm?t=1696403600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/a1d5401f4dce2de6e93f03b1ec032c78.mp4?t=1696403600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You're set to unravel the mystery of your enigmatic neighbor \u2014 Dr. Wood. You'll familiarize yourself with hoppers, aid in resolving age-old conflicts among feuding clans, travel between worlds, and this is just a glimpse into a universe that continues to evolve daily.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/68f0a73b652ace33f368309e38ff801d.poster.avif?t=1696403600\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/68f0a73b652ace33f368309e38ff801d.webm?t=1696403600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/68f0a73b652ace33f368309e38ff801d.mp4?t=1696403600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The game will receive regular updates and extensions: each month, we'll introduce new enhancements, refining your experience and introducing fresh levels and mysteries.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/95d32cc4cf1e3e5313a6a14b140fc19b.poster.avif?t=1696403600\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/95d32cc4cf1e3e5313a6a14b140fc19b.webm?t=1696403600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/95d32cc4cf1e3e5313a6a14b140fc19b.mp4?t=1696403600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Some items and skills can be acquired with real money. These purchases can facilitate your journey and introduce new exhilarating elements.<br><br>Enjoy your time in Strange Hill!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/14ca783af7da1f5eee80645ea4a82766.poster.avif?t=1696403600\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/14ca783af7da1f5eee80645ea4a82766.webm?t=1696403600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/14ca783af7da1f5eee80645ea4a82766.mp4?t=1696403600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>This is a third-person adventure thriller with an interactive environment and intriguing quests in an open world. Solve puzzles, uncover the secrets of the suspicious Dr. Wood and his assistant Gloria, who reside in Strange Hill City.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/1d197d32a4d45f31eba5fbca97ea6b3d.poster.avif?t=1696403600\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/1d197d32a4d45f31eba5fbca97ea6b3d.webm?t=1696403600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/1d197d32a4d45f31eba5fbca97ea6b3d.mp4?t=1696403600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your adventure begins in the unique town of Strange Hill, where you'll encounter distinctive creatures and the denizens of this enigmatic locale. Here, you'll discover numerous valuable and unique items to interact with. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559790/extras/7b6a6fed7efe2c331af163fa65a5ecbd.poster.avif?t=1696403600\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse